# Consistent line endings across macOS, Linux, and Windows checkouts.
# Detect text files and check them out with LF everywhere — Go tooling,
# Makefiles, and shell scripts all expect LF, and forcing it kills the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" churn on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never normalize or line-ending-convert.
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary
*.tdb   binary
